  "question": {
    "text": "Let <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#969;</mi><mo>&#8800;</mo><mn>1</mn></math> be a cube root of unity. Then the minimum of the set <math><mo>{</mo><msup><mrow><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">b</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#969;</mi><mo>+</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#969;</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>:</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mo>,</mo><mtext>&#8201;</mtext><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">b</mi><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi></math> distinct non<math><mo>&#8211;</mo></math>zero integers <math><mo>}</mo></math> equals ________",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [],
  "correctValue": "3",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>If <math> <mi>z</mi> </math> is a complex number<br />Then <math> <mrow> <mo>|</mo><mi>z</mi><msup> <mo>|</mo> <mn>2</mn> </msup> <mo>=</mo><mi>z</mi><mover accent=\"true\"> <mi>z</mi> <mo>&#175;</mo> </mover> </mrow> </math><br />Now,<br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" xmlns:m=\"http://schemas.openxmlformats.org/officeDocument/2006/math\" xmlns:mml=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi><mi>&#969;</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>c</mi><msup><mi>&#969;</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi><mi>&#969;</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>c</mi><msup><mi>&#969;</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mover><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi><mi>&#969;</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>c</mi><msup><mi>&#969;</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><mo>&#175;</mo></mover></mfenced></math><br /><math xmlns:m=\"http://schemas.openxmlformats.org/officeDocument/2006/math\" xmlns:mml=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mrow><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi><mi>&#969;</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>c</mi><msup><mrow><mi>&#969;</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi><mi>&#969;</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>c</mi><msup><mrow><mi>&#969;</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>&#969;</mi></mrow><mo>-</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mi>c</mi><msup><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>&#969;</mi></mrow><mo>-</mo></mover></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" xmlns:m=\"http://schemas.openxmlformats.org/officeDocument/2006/math\" xmlns:mml=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>i</mi><mi>f</mi><mtext>&#8201;</mtext><mi>a</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mi>R</mi><mo>&#8658;</mo><mover><mi>a</mi><mo>-</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><mi>a</mi></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" xmlns:m=\"http://schemas.openxmlformats.org/officeDocument/2006/math\" xmlns:mml=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mover><mrow><msub><mi>z</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><msub><mi>z</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><mo>&#175;</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><msub><mover><mi>z</mi><mo>-</mo></mover><mn>1</mn></msub><msub><mover><mi>z</mi><mo>-</mo></mover><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><math xmlns:m=\"http://schemas.openxmlformats.org/officeDocument/2006/math\" xmlns:mml=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>&#969;</mi></mrow><mo>-</mo></mover><mo>=</mo><msup><mrow><mi>&#969;</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>,</mo><mtext>&#8201;&#8201;</mtext><msup><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mrow><mi>&#969;</mi></mrow><mo>-</mo></mover></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mi>&#969;</mi></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><br /><math xmlns:m=\"http://schemas.openxmlformats.org/officeDocument/2006/math\" xmlns:mml=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mrow><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi><mi>&#969;</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>c</mi><msup><mrow><mi>&#969;</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi><mi>&#969;</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>c</mi><msup><mrow><mi>&#969;</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi><msup><mrow><mi>&#969;</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>c</mi><mi>&#969;</mi></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><math xmlns:m=\"http://schemas.openxmlformats.org/officeDocument/2006/math\" xmlns:mml=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><msup><mrow><mi>a</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mi>b</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mi>c</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>-</mo><mi>a</mi><mi>b</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>b</mi><mi>c</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>c</mi><mi>a</mi></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" xmlns:m=\"http://schemas.openxmlformats.org/officeDocument/2006/math\" xmlns:mml=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mtext>&#8757;&#8201;&#8201;</mtext><msup><mi>&#969;</mi><mn>3</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mtext>&#8201;&#8201;</mtext><mn>1</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>&#969;</mi><mo>+</mo><msup><mi>&#969;</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><math xmlns:m=\"http://schemas.openxmlformats.org/officeDocument/2006/math\" xmlns:mml=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>|</mo><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi><mi>&#969;</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>c</mi><msup><mrow><mi>&#969;</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><msup><mrow><mo>|</mo></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>[</mo><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>b</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>b</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>c</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>c</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>a</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>]</mo></math><br />Now for this to be minimum<br />Take <math xmlns:m=\"http://schemas.openxmlformats.org/officeDocument/2006/math\" xmlns:mml=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>a</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>,</mo><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>b</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>,</mo><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>c</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>,</mo></math> as <math xmlns:m=\"http://schemas.openxmlformats.org/officeDocument/2006/math\" xmlns:mml=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>a</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>b</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>&#160;</mi><mi>c</mi></math> are distinct and non-zero integers<br />Minimum of&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" xmlns:m=\"http://schemas.openxmlformats.org/officeDocument/2006/math\" xmlns:mml=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mfenced open=\"|\" close=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>a</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi><mi>&#969;</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>c</mi><msup><mi>&#969;</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn></math></p>",
